; generated by gen_batch.py; run with Execute RAM:b/run
FAILAT 1000
Protect RAM:b/apkg +e
Protect RAM:b/putfile +e
MakeDir RAM:L
Echo >RAM:L/net.txt "network"
Lab net
RAM:b/putfile >RAM:L/netlog RAM:L/net.txt net.txt 8821
If WARN
  Wait 10
  Skip net BACK
EndIf
Echo >RAM:L/env.txt "apkg:"
